        "label": "1st quarter",
        "score": "BOS 42, DAL 9",
        "text": "Jordan Walsh scored 8 of his 11 points in the quarter, and it was 19–4 when Dallas called its first timeout at 7:14. Derrick White hit three straight threes and outscored the Mavericks by himself, 11–9. Dallas shot 2-of-18 (0-of-8 from three) with six turnovers, and Baylor Scheierman's steal and dunk with 45 seconds left made it 42–9."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd quarter",
        "score": "BOS 67, DAL 37",
        "text": "Dallas won the quarter by three and cut the lead to 24 during a 9–0 run. Cooper Flagg had a fouled jumper and a steal-and-dunk, and Hugo Gonzalez hit a three after grabbing two straight offensive rebounds."
