        "label": "4th quarter",
        "score": "Final: BOS 131, DAL 94",
        "text": "Boston's starters sat the whole quarter. Devin Carter played all 12 minutes in his season debut, and rookie Chris Cenac Jr. scored 6 points in the final seven minutes."
